,792],[364,813],[180,394],[425,775],[285,759],[430,773],[593,815],[311,254],[216,706],[515,794],[311,224],[551,801],[299,247],[449,700],[868,671],[402,780],[505,803],[671,814],[551,108],[435,763],[350,808],[707,813],[299,231],[616,781],[324,230],[718,606],[261,717],[361,295],[242,428],[275,659],[547,796],[550,813],[680,937],[880,547],[612,707],[556,805],[482,818],[330,477],[617,752],[623,755],[244,943],[422,359],[650,624],[621,777],[654,793],[493,609],[611,755],[385,816]]}},"text":{"2":"One morning, Jodie pressed her nose against the window. Tiny white flakes were dancing outside. \u201cSNOW!\u201d she shouted. She pulled on her hat and mittens and raced next door to Bodie\u2019s house as fast as her legs could go, with Waffles right at her heels.","12":"Bodie pushed a carrot into place for the nose. Then, whoosh! Waffles grabbed the carrot and dashed away. \u201cWaffles! Come back with that nose!\u201d cried Jodie. Around the snowman they ran, again and again and again.","14":"At last, Waffles dropped the carrot and wagged his tail. The snowman got his nose back and a cozy scarf. \u201cI name him Sir Snowsalot,\u201d Jodie said with a bow. Bodie bowed too. Waffles sneezed.","26":"The next day, they baked cookies with Jodie\u2019s mom. Jodie poured the flour very fast. POOF! A big white cloud filled the air. Bodie blinked. \u201cNow you\u2019re a snowman too,\u201d laughed Jodie.","44":"In the yard between their houses stood a little pine tree, just their size. Bodie\u2019s dad brushed off the snow. Jodie\u2019s mom set down a box of tiny lights. \u201cThis tree is ours,\u201d said Bodie. \u201cOurs,\u201d Jodie agreed."}}